      "content": "<title id=\"WaJnduiqiojpERxSjoUcxFyznYe\">笔记信息</title><h1 id=\"doxcntA8MSm4t83cLHkrmkrqsQM\">笔记信息</h1><ul><li id=\"doxcn2KL58pUO0JfiAGBqd93Egc\"><b>笔记ID：</b>67e4b41a000000001d01c2fc</li><li id=\"doxcnI5ulQe6mF3iGo8YpqbcAKh\"><b>笔记链接：</b><a href=\"https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/67e4b41a000000001d01c2fc?source=webshare&amp;xhsshare=pc_web&amp;xsec_token=ABttNtvXa3bO9z6GnMPdFqyJMu6e2lbCJm4Wt8u-0sGbQ=&amp;xsec_source=pc_share\">打开原笔记</a></li><li id=\"doxcniMSbKAvn28yEUfus1ePcoe\"><b>笔记类型：</b>图文</li><li id=\"doxcnF0BUrVgQdBEP2Oiyf5Ytkb\"><b>笔记标题：</b>孕妈必吃4道补叶酸素菜🌱</li><li id=\"doxcnq1MZVymWqNR12b10UKdDOg\"><b>笔记正文：</b>🌿孕妈补叶酸必吃4道素菜！简单又营养💚<br/>1️⃣ 清炒茼蒿(微辣版🌶️）<br/>茼蒿叶酸丰富，清炒保留原味，脆嫩爽口，孕期必备！<br/>2️⃣ 清炒小白菜(微辣版🌶️）<br/>小白菜高叶酸低热量，简单翻炒，清爽解腻，营养满分✨<br/>3️⃣ 辣炒甘蓝(微辣版🌶️）<br/>甘蓝叶酸+纤维，加点蒜末小米辣提味，开胃又下饭～<br/>4️⃣ 菠菜炒鸡蛋(微辣版🌶️）<br/>经典搭配！菠菜补叶酸，鸡蛋优质蛋白，香嫩可口🥚<br/>💡小贴士：叶酸对宝宝发育超重要，孕妈们快安排起来！</li><li id=\"doxcnAchpq4LtDeIWj4fj1fQBYd\"><b>Hashtag：</b>#孕期食谱 #叶酸食物 #孕妈必备 #健康饮食 #孕期营养 #素菜也可以很好吃 #怀孕吃什么 #长胎不长肉</li><li id=\"doxcnVGk65H2uoq4k2wuUzJDpnh\"><b>博主ID：</b>6142585e00000000020211e5</li><li id=\"doxcnnsWUm1STsehxxG0AdMws1g\"><b>博主昵称：</b>小雪的孕产日记</li><li id=\"doxcnNT2G7ETB6Px8zyk74ACF9g\"><b>点赞量：</b>1119</li><li id=\"doxcnVJ9I99lZcUJQikL2LLjDne\"><b>收藏量：</b>665</li><li id=\"doxcnAR5gLqVCjnvtkyWfZNLsvc\"><b>评论量：</b>未采集</li><li id=\"doxcnlCWyPbmV6MLPE440d4CNHc\"><b>分享量：</b>367</li><li id=\"doxcn9Tyz9S08eDOv18JeHH9Fyf\"><b>发布时间：</b>2025-03-27 10:12</li><li id=\"doxcnYifF7IjD6IjtlIMQyrrHyd\"><b>更新时间：</b>2025-03-27 10:12</li><li id=\"doxcncQnLUcQDlutalfWaI3UxOe\"><b>图片数量：</b>5</li><li id=\"doxcnuqBEwk1u0GcbAtBjJPS3qg\"><b>采集时间：</b>2026-09-12</li><li id=\"doxcnMLB9ixQqvKKqeA03cGgMid\"><b>笔记封面链接：</b><a href=\"https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609122253/76a403716aa74bc17bfe945ab4009265/1040g2sg31fh179dsmq705oa2b1f0k4f5rmcgep0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3\">打开原图</a></li><li id=\"doxcn5My36vjU5hCzJJccnYKS6e\"><b>笔记图片文档：</b><a href=\"https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/VTdbwiHcaitZp2kzpPncktMznyc\">笔记图片文档</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"doxcnvUCMUC6P3LOPw12KCaFoUe\">笔记图片链接</h2><ul><li id=\"doxcn7jjHrRTO75PSs9vhlFWwTh\"><a href=\"https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609122253/76a403716aa74bc17bfe945ab4009265/1040g2sg31fh179dsmq705oa2b1f0k4f5rmcgep0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3\">第1张原图</a></li><li id=\"doxcntr1Mu2cjovcsDWueuhsf1d\"><a href=\"https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609122253/108c8a1ad4c1e700c1151c3253fb75dc/1040g2sg31fh179dsmq7g5oa2b1f0k4f5lljd52o!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3\">第2张原图</a></li><li id=\"doxcnlkcMAwN6yA6oh2JJoPpq8g\"><a href=\"https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609122253/40f21493b5e4ba717c70c5a7fbf631f2/1040g2sg31fh179dsmq805oa2b1f0k4f5s9knb00!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3\">第3张原图</a></li><li id=\"doxcn8Ymf1hZFN6L2jqATHbKtdc\"><a href=\"https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609122253/c15756d8d63124248971f13f4fc35775/1040g2sg31fh179dsmq8g5oa2b1f0k4f5n4paqtg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3\">第4张原图</a></li><li id=\"doxcnidJI3yCPTTpTOzDmbyynKd\"><a href=\"https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609122253/c150f848b9062a2de2aba9d0d4267e2f/1040g2sg31fh179dsmq905oa2b1f0k4f5pl1g1f0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3\">第5张原图</a></li></ul>",
